cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
authors:
  - family-names: "Hostettler"
    given-names: "Marco"
    affiliation: "Coworker Research (Coworkerz)"
title: "hexa-ntk"
abstract: >-
  Research infrastructure for neural-operator runs on hexagonal grids:
  checkpoint, EMA and DDP tooling plus config and shape contracts for
  GINO/GAOT. The operators themselves are not implemented here and no model
  has been trained yet. Developed with the DI (digital intelligence) Coworker
  system.
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/marcohost33-maker/hexa-ntk"
keywords:
  - neural operator
  - hexagonal grid
  - finite volume
  - verification and validation
  - preregistration
